# Agora — MCP Service Hub

**API Gateway for AI Agents.** Discover, monitor, and orchestrate all your MCP services from one place.

## What it does
- 🔍 Auto-discovers MCP services in your workspace (4 strategies)
- 🫀 Health checks with circuit breaker (CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN) + webhook alerts
- 🚀 Pipeline orchestration (sequential/parallel/streaming) + DAG visualization
- 🔌 Multi-protocol routing (MCP, REST, gRPC, WebSocket, stdio)
- 📡 Event bus with publish/subscribe/log
- 🛒 MCP Tool Marketplace (18 built-in services + GitHub install)
- 📊 Web Dashboard (glassmorphism + WebSocket real-time + topology SVG)
- 📈 Prometheus /metrics + P50/P90/P99 latency
- 🔗 Service topology visualization (Hub-Spoke with protocol coloring)

## Quick Install
```bash
pip install agora-mcp
agora discover
agora web
```

## MCP Tools (14)
**Registry:** `register_service` · `list_services` · `check_health`
**Router:** `add_route` · `list_routes` · `route_call`
**Proxy:** `proxy_connect` · `proxy_call` · `proxy_status` · `proxy_add_service` · `proxy_remove_service`
**Event Bus:** `publish_event` · `subscribe_event` · `get_event_log`

